note """analysis check: a use binds the wrong number of names. `screening` declares two outputs and bindings are POSITIONAL in signature order, so binding one name silently drops the second and mis-names nothing that would otherwise be caught."""
flow screening (Order) -> ok OkResult, bad ErrResult
import "github.com/acme/fraud"
import "acme.dev/flows/warehouse"
branch check fraud.Clean from in -> ok, bad

flow main
source ingest Poll
use screen screening from ingest -> clean
sink store warehouse.Insert from clean
